{
  "conclusions": [
    "Short-window DataRateLimits is accepted/readable and reduces standalone bursts, but valid duration + two limits regresses app resume to ~1.7fps; rejected.",
    "VBR/VBV mode reduces resume P95 to176ms with two inflight and94ms with three, but steady fps34/36 is below the unchanged50fps goal and build26 baseline; both rejected.",
    "VBR encoder callback durations around20-56ms and busy-driven60->30fps retreats require pipeline/throughput and quality investigation. An extra retained frame did not solve it.",
    "No device install, quality acceptance, server change or production parameter change. Step5 remains incomplete.",
    "Read-only final fixed-rate VBR probe measured max_inflight=3 and tail_output_ms=0. This is not an App inflight-limit or throughput acceptance result.",
    "Fixed-rate VBR completed500frames with max3inflight and no tail backlog, so do not conclude hardware itself cannot sustain60fps. Prioritize testing dynamic rate/FPS property-update and reconfiguration overhead; hypothesis not established causally."
  ],
